{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124161509291-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124173543\"/><p>男童由家人抱住送院救治。</p><p>今午(24日)3時05分，一名歲半泰國籍男童與家人，乘搭昂坪360纜車由昂坪前往東涌途中，男童突然失去知覺及陷入昏迷，其36歲父親電報案。政府飛行服務隊派出直升機飛至彌勒山轉向站，把該男童及其家人吊起，送往東區醫院救治。據了解，男童接受人工呼吸急救後，抵達醫院時回復清醒，其昏迷原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.882179+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:15:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.747989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:17.284567+00:00","content_hash":"41a35c9f1c40ca15f3231d6c9e54a333cb29f7a6faef5c40fee8267818a88af3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.882179+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}